# Goal
float64 position  # Commanded gripper position in meters (0.0 to 0.025)
---
# Result  
bool success      # True if gripper reached the target or detected an object
string message    # Status message
float64 final_position  # Final gripper position achieved
---
# Feedback
float64 current_position  # Current gripper position during movement
string status            # Current status (moving, detecting, etc.) 